        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "The ruins of Annuminas were at one time the greatest libraries of the ancient realm of Arthedain. Arthedain like Annuminas was besieged by The Dark Lord Saurons chief lieutenant, The Witch King. The Witch King, a foul ringwraith decimated this land around 1,000 years ago."
          }
        }
      },
