        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "A foul demon of the ancient world, long forgotten since the dawning of the Light. Azagoth has been awoken and sent to defile the well of Souls. He will try to breach the portal! If he does, he will feast upon the unborn souls and massive still birth will be the result. You must stop Azagoth before he can breach the portal!"
