        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Thank you, from the bottom of my heart and my deepest thanks to you! The portal is at the Library, the center of town. Please hurry. And when it is done -- when you can set that creature's head down in front of me -- there is a thing the wardens left in my keeping that I will gladly put into your hands. It is not mine to give before then."
