        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "You have defeated Azagoth! The Well of Souls is shut against him, and every soul who ever worked in these halls stands in your debt. Take this, then -- the key to the coffers we were never able to open. But heed this warning: two of those coffers are bound by an old warding of the Numenoreans -- sealed against any thief's craft, so that only this key will ever turn them. And the key... something, something, in the way of magic... it will unlock but a single one before it crumbles away to nothing. So choose with care, for you may claim the treasure of only one of the two warded chests."
